WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.110
Most of the time, a big 250 pound yellow jaguar, I have literally been in one's presence and not been able to see it because the pattern disruption of their spots somehow blends them into the forest, the dappled light in the forest.

00:00:14.665 --> 00:00:17.225
And you're just looking around and you go...

00:00:17.385 --> 00:00:20.265
You have this moment of realization.

